      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Common Eti: atherothrombotic occlusion of lrg arteries; cerebral embolism (embolic infarct); nonthrombotic occlusion of sm, deep cerebral arteries (lacunar infarct); prox arterial stenosis w hypotension reducing flow in watershed zones (hemodynamic CVA); ⍉cause = identified in one-third @ d/c (cryptogenic)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 0,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": 0,
     "spaceBefore": 6,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": null
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Sx"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Sx depend on the part of the brain affected; deficit patterns often suggest the affected a., but correlation = often inexact"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Middle cerebral a. (common): contralat hemiparesis (worse in the arm and face than the leg), dysarthria, hemianesthesia, contralat homonymous hemianopia, aphasia (dom hemisphere) or apraxia and sensory neglect (nondominant hemisphere)"
     }
    ]
   },
