     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Thrombectomy was previously restricted to w.in 6 hrs of onset (internal carotid or middle cerebral a. occlusion); later tx may be justified @ comprehensive CVA centers when clin and/or imaging findings suggest substantial tissue @ risk (penumbra): benefit up to 16 hrs in DEFUSE 3 (sm infarct, lrger penumbra) and "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       },
       {
        "type": "highlight",
        "attrs": {
         "hex": "FF0000"
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "up to 24 hrs"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " in DAWN (lrg mismatch b/n infarct vol and clin deficit)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
